## How to cite this page

Sunny Patel, "UK Marketing Salary Statistics," sunnypatel.co.uk, updated 24 September 2026, citing ONS ASHE 2025 provisional. Link to this page and to the underlying ONS release rather than restating the figures as your own research.

{% pullquote cite="On what this page does and does not measure" %}
ASHE counts employee jobs through PAYE records. It cannot tell you what a self-employed SEO consultant charges, and SOC 2020 has no SEO-specific occupation code.
{% /pullquote %}
